Excerpt:
The elf seemed put out as his brutish companion was already helping himself to touching and experiencing the mysterious woman. Her lashes fluttered at the attention, and she returned her hands to the elf's, tugging him into her and feeling the press of their two bodies on either side of her.
The more reluctant elf was taken a bit by surprise with her eagerness to be sandwiched between the two thugs, or perhaps some hint of modesty or prudishness flashed to life for a second. Either way, it did not last too long, for as he watched his friend savour her touch, her feel, her scent, he reached his own hands to her hips and leaned in, head tilted. It was a sheepish first kiss for a roguish looking sort, but he moistly lingered at the corner of her lips, his thumbs feeling over her outline.
